    <title>On the Fundamental Eigenvalues gap of Sturm-Liouville Operators</title>
    <updated>2024-07-03T07:47:13Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.02459v2" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2407.02459v2" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We use methods of direct optimization as in [9] to find the minimizers of the fundamental gap of Sturm-Liouville operators on an interval, under the constraint that the potential is of single-well form and that the weight function is of single-barrier form, and under similar constraints expressed in terms of convexity.</summary>
